stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> planned
  planned --> running: first run recorded
  running --> running: another run
  running --> concluded: verdict written
  running --> abandoned: stopped early
  planned --> abandoned: never started
  state concluded {
    [*] --> supported
    [*] --> refuted
    [*] --> inconclusive
    inconclusive --> followup: narrower eval
  }
  concluded --> [*]
  abandoned --> [*]
